[0.021, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[10G\u001b[2m2\u001b[13G\u001b[22m \u001b[15G`Summary`) are th\u001b[33G gate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[13G\u001b[22m-\u001b[15G**Scene** (`engi\u001b[32Ge/scene`). An EnTT regis\u001b[57Gry loaded from and saved to YAML\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m1834\u001b[13G\u001b[22m  (`source/test/content/sc\u001b[40Gne/orbit.yaml`\u001b[55Gat\u001b[58Greal\u001b[63Gscale,\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74G`main.yaml`,\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gmodels,\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103Gdefault)\u001b[112Gth\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m      \u001b[22m rough `serialise`'s archives, at\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1832 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  file version 2: a field the file does not know is refused, naming its path and line, and the       \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m5\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfile version 3, a file \u001b[39Gf\u001b[41Gversion\u001b[49G2 read through its migration\u001b[78G(\u001b[80Gts `celestial`\u001b[95Grecord\u001b[102Gis\u001b[105G`body`):\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1836 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  a field the file does not know is refused, naming its path and line, and the                       \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m7\u001b[15G\u001b[22ml\u001b[17Gader and the writer share one check of wh\u001b[59Gt a file may say. It has transform, parent,\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[15G\u001b[22mw\u001b[17Grld-transform, ca\u001b[35Gera,\u001b[40Glight (a poin\u001b[54G or a s\u001b[62Got, with a r\u001b[75Gnge), sun, sky,\u001b[92Golour grade\u001b[104Gand mesh\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m1839\u001b[14G\u001b[22m components\u001b[26G(a\u001b[29GglTF\u001b[34Gmodel\u001b[40Gby\u001b[43Gvirtual\u001b[51Gpath\u001b[56Gor\u001b[59Ga\u001b[61Gprocedural\u001b[72Gshape\u001b[78G-\u001b[80GUV,\u001b[84Gico\u001b[88Gor\u001b[91Gcube\u001b[96Gsphere,\u001b[104Gbox,\u001b[109Gring,\r\u001b[5C