[0.029, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G2. The plan's \"To\u001b[21Grevisit\"\u001b[30Gitem:\u001b[36GI'd\u001b[40Gkeep\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gsave's\u001b[56Gversion-1\u001b[66Gmigration\u001b[76Gin\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83Gengine,\u001b[91Gbecause\u001b[99Gversion\u001b[107G1's\u001b[111Ginfo\u001b[116Gwas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gt\u001b[8Ge engine's\u001b[19Gown rec\u001b[27Grd. Ag\u001b[35Ge?\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6GS\u001b[8Gall I push both repositories and move Manifest's pin?\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThis is a natural point to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[39m bef\u001b[43Gr\u001b[46Gclosing out.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 1h 3m 47s · done 9:48 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mBefore we do any of the fixes that the review surfaced I want to drop some restrictions from the migration policy. \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mAll the save games are in manifest and jettison and under our control. We can simply rewrite those files for each \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mmigration\u001b[13Gand save the e\u001b[28Gfort\u001b[33Gof writing a new migration\u001b[60Gset for\u001b[68Gevery file change. I want you to offer a plan for\u001b[118Ga \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsafe way to move forward without adding migrations with every\u001b[66Ghange. We will\u001b[81Grewrite those save files each time \u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255muntil we start player t\u001b[27Gsting, at which poi\u001b[47Gt it becomes\u001b[60Gworth migration costs.\u001b[39m                                      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m9\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd /home/ivan/projects/manifest && rg -n \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\"VehicleMigrat