[0.402, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5G- the world's steps 1–4: the type renames, renaming fields of queued commands\u001b[83G(the\u001b[88Gnested\u001b[95Gdestination\u001b[107Gand\u001b[111Gthe\u001b[115Gpick's\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msystem\u001b[39m included) and skipping the retired dock components;\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7Gthe save game's version-1 step, which also settles th\u001b[61G open\u001b[67G\"To\u001b[71Grevisit\"\u001b[80Gitem;\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bcomponent chain\u001b[27G \u001b[29Gf \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInFrame\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDestination\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBody\u001b[39m,\u001b[62Gplus\u001b[67Gthe\u001b[71Gdock's;\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bp\u001b[9Gysics' r\u001b[18Gaders for\u001b[28Glayouts 3 and 4;\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[9Ge dock\u001b[16Gd\u001b[18Gfinitions' steps,\u001b[36Gand the scene's\u001b[52Gversion-2\u001b[62Gstep.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mKept:\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- the\u001b[11Gmigration\u001b[21Gmachinery\u001b[31Gin\u001b[34G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mserialise\u001b[39m,\u001b[45Gwith\u001b[50Gits\u001b[54Gown\u001b[58Gtests\u001b[64Gon\u001b[67Gtest\u001b[72Gformats,\u001b[81Gready\u001b[87Gfor\u001b[91Glater;\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDock::*Migrations()\u001b[31G\u001b[39mfunctions, now with no\u001b[54Gsteps, because Manifest'\u001b[79G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcontent\u001b[39m cal\u001b[92Gs them;\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bloading a save written by another Jolt\u001b[46Gversion\u001b[54Gby rebuilding its bodies.\u001b[80GThat handles a d\u001b[97Gpendency\u001b[106Gchange,\u001b[114Gnot\u001b[118Gour\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gown form\u001b[16Gt, and cos\u001b[27Gs nothi\u001b[35Gg.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThis\u001b[8Galso\u001b[13Gmakes\u001b[19Greview\u001b[26Gfindings\u001b[35GF5\u001b[38Gand\u001b[42GF6\u001b[45Gmoot,\u00