 simply be d\u001b[73Gleted.\u001b[80G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe rule, until player testing\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mA format change updates the format in place.\u001b[51G\u001b[22mNo\u001b[54Gversion\u001b[62Gbump\u001b[67Gand\u001b[71Gno\u001b[74Gmigration\u001b[84Gstep.\u001b[90GEvery\u001b[96Gfile\u001b[101Gwe\u001b[104Gown\u001b[108Gthat\u001b[113Gholds\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gthe format is rewritten in the same commit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mVersion numbers stay at their current val\u001b[76G\u001b[22me\u001b[78Gversion\u001b[86Gbytes,\u001b[93Gso\u001b[96Gnot\u001b[100Gbumping\u001b[108Gmeans\u001b[114Gno\u001b[117Gpin\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
