d\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  a sandboxed push can't use SSH here\u001b[42G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GStill open: the extraction's clo\u001b[36Ge-ou\u001b[41G records, which\u001b[57Gare the\u001b[65Groadmap\u001b[73Gr\u001b[75Gw moving\u001b[84Gto\u001b[87Ghistory\u001b[95Gand\u001b[99G8c\u001b[102Gmarked\u001b[109Gdone\u001b[114Gin\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[1B  plan. Shall I do those next?\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mwin\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
