[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+12\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, ran \u001b[1m5\u001b[22m shell commands, recalled \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m memories, wrote \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m memories \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe space extraction is now recorded as done, committed in Jettison as \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m6a31f87\u001b[39m. I haven't pushed it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRoadmap:\u001b[22m the \"Space extraction\" row is gone from the open work. The status paragraph says it is done, with Manifest\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bpinned to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m14fc23a\u001b[39m, and that Manifest's W12 is next.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mStation traffic lanes:\u001b[22m still parked. The entry now says the decoupling they waited for is done and that they are\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BManifest's work, built on the engine's slots and portals.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mHistory:\u001b[22m a \"Space extraction\" row in the neutral SDK and Manifest integration table summarises all eight slices.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPlan:\u001b[22m marked done, all eight slices. Part 8c records Manifest's boundary assessment, the consumer matrix and the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthree review rounds, including how the third round's findings were settled by the new rule that formats change\u001b[116Gin\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bplace until player testing.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMemory:\u001b[13G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[17G\"decouple\u001b[27Gspace\u001b[33Gfirst\"\u001b[40Gnote\u001b[45Gnow\u001b[49Gsays\u001b[54Gspace\u001b[60Gfeatures\u001b[69Ggo\u001b[72Gin\u001b[75GManifest's\u001b[86G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mspace\u001b[92G\u001b[39mmodule,\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Gthe\u001b[108Gengine\u001b[115Gonly\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bgets capabi\u001b[18Gties\u001b[23Gwith a neutr\u001b[36Gl name.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7Gchanges\u001b[15Gare\u001b[19Gdocuments\u001b[29Gonly,\u001b[35Gso\u001b[38GI\u001b[40Gran\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Ggate's\u001b[55Gmarkdown\u001b[64Glink\u001b[69Gcheck\u001b[75Grather\u001b[82Gthan\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gfull\u001b[96Ggate;\u001b[102Gall\u001b[106Glinks\u001b[112Gpass.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  Shall I push \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m6a31f87\u001b[39m? This\u001b[30Gis\u001b[33Ga\u001b[35Gnatural\u001b[43Gpoint\u001b[49Gto\u001b[52G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[61G\u001b[39mor\u001b[64Gstart\u001b[70Ga\u001b[72Gnew\u001b[76Gsession\u001b[84Gbefore\u001b[91GW12.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCooked for \u001b[20Gdone 10:47 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B❯ \r\u001b[41C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m← 1\u001b[46Gagent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
